{"4927030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Last Buzz", "steam_appid": 4927030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/60556c378f4cdb5203002bea3f0bfcff.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/60556c378f4cdb5203002bea3f0bfcff.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/60556c378f4cdb5203002bea3f0bfcff.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The flies are in your kitchen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’re on the ceiling. One is hiding in your fridge. Another just rescued his idiot friend from a jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And someone is drawing on your wall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Last Buzz.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One side plays as the flies: eat, hide, escape, troll the humans, and somehow keep your swarm alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other side plays as the humans: protect the house, hunt the flies, and shove every last one of them into a jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s basically hide-and-seek if everyone involved was a problem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/24b05116ac9a173de5a9fa40cc3272b9.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE SMALL. BE FAST. BE ANNOYING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a fly. Act like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around the house, sprint across tables, crawl up walls and ceilings, squeeze through tiny gaps, and disappear somewhere the humans absolutely swear they already checked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's one problem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're always hungry.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find food and keep eating or you'll eventually drop into a Food Coma—which is a very embarrassing way to get stuffed into a jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if one of your friends gets caught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go get the idiot back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break teammates out of jars, rescue knocked-down flies, sneak through vents and tiny passages, and use keyholes to see what's waiting on the other side of a door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even spray graffiti around the house, paint camouflage onto surfaces, or leave fake flies behind to make the humans question their eyesight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive together. Or at least make your death extremely inconvenient.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/831e81b89aa589e6b5b75429368e9bff.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/831e81b89aa589e6b5b75429368e9bff.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/831e81b89aa589e6b5b75429368e9bff.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db0a6efde4a963e36100b96f18555e2f.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db0a6efde4a963e36100b96f18555e2f.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db0a6efde4a963e36100b96f18555e2f.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/0c6a3457e4914a411abd7915f345a307.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/0c6a3457e4914a411abd7915f345a307.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/0c6a3457e4914a411abd7915f345a307.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/4540b2c4915471dd686cecbaa7390f1b.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU’RE THE HUNTER. FLIES ARE IN YOUR HOUSE. DEAL WITH THEM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They ate your food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're crawling through your vents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone drew a picture on your refrigerator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enough.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your dart rifle and start hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray cabinets to flush flies out of hiding. Slap sticky traps across escape routes. Drop laser mines near vents. Throw smoke grenades into rooms and watch everyone panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, one of the smoke grenades makes flies dance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We're professionals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock a fly down and shove it into a jar before its friends can rescue it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the whole swarm and the house is yours again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probably.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/a3dbf4791bbafd255ad05a75b4044f96.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/a3dbf4791bbafd255ad05a75b4044f96.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/a3dbf4791bbafd255ad05a75b4044f96.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/614a2d7eaef65f23e787e9d87ca622e9.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/614a2d7eaef65f23e787e9d87ca622e9.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/614a2d7eaef65f23e787e9d87ca622e9.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6b4f3ec44a65ef5395cf8fb98ddd5967.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6b4f3ec44a65ef5395cf8fb98ddd5967.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6b4f3ec44a65ef5395cf8fb98ddd5967.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db07e4ee79bd1760fd739af9104c2c81.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/301573c43344f89ca22b379a38aa2b9e.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/301573c43344f89ca22b379a38aa2b9e.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/301573c43344f89ca22b379a38aa2b9e.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YES, THE FLIES HAVE SPRAY PAINT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was giving flies spray paint a good idea?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they draw on basically everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag walls. Draw stupid things on furniture. Leave messages for the humans. Mark routes for your swarm. Turn someone's perfectly normal kitchen into a crime scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But graffiti isn't <i>only</i> for being annoying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint camouflage directly onto surfaces to blend in, create fake flies to waste the humans' time, or make yourself a hiding spot where there wasn't one before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art has never been more irritating.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/f123677182e9052ebdf24b701e164289.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/abc04b73ef7c2c0891a52e9ab6ed01c0.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/abc04b73ef7c2c0891a52e9ab6ed01c0.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/abc04b73ef7c2c0891a52e9ab6ed01c0.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6e487cad01a5aa83a157e3411c3739d1.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/e3652653cba288dceffeec184218c635.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/e3652653cba288dceffeec184218c635.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/e3652653cba288dceffeec184218c635.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERYTHING IS HUGE WHEN YOU'RE A FLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kitchen counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bedroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A toilet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To you? Normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To a fly? Basically an open-world survival game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One minute you're hiding on a ceiling fan. The next you're sprinting across someone's dinner while a human fills the room with smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide inside drawers, cabinets, shelves, fridges and whatever else you can squeeze yourself into. Use vents, tiny doors and sewer grates to move around the house without being spotted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when someone opens the cabinet you're hiding in...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try not to panic.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER IMPORTANT STUFF</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–6 PLAYER ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</strong> — From tense little 1v1 hunts to six-player chaos with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</strong> — Coordinate, scream, bargain, lie, trash-talk. Normal communication stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL FLY MOVEMENT</strong> — Fly, sprint, crawl across walls and ceilings, and squeeze through tiny spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOOD &amp; ENERGY</strong> — Keep eating and manage your energy unless you'd like to pass out at the worst possible moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESCUE YOUR FRIENDS</strong> — Knocked down? Stuck in a jar? Your teammates can still save you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUMAN TOYS</strong> — Dart rifles, aerosol sprays, sticky traps, laser mines and multiple types of smoke grenades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACTIVE HOUSE</strong> — Open doors and cabinets, hide inside furniture, peek through keyholes, crawl through vents and find sneaky routes between rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAFFITI &amp; CAMOUFLAGE</strong> — Draw on the house, disguise yourself, create decoys or just annoy the humans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUIDED TUTORIAL</strong> — Learn the important stuff before your friends start yelling at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/625f9a2bb61107b70672f22e8746d20c.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/625f9a2bb61107b70672f22e8746d20c.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/625f9a2bb61107b70672f22e8746d20c.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND WE'RE NOT DONE YET.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Buzz is being built for <strong>Early Access</strong>, and we're still adding new mechanics, items, hazards, maps, and other questionable ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will probably get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That's part of the fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If chaotic multiplayer, tiny flies with terrible judgment, and humans slowly losing control of their own house sounds like your kind of thing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Last Buzz and follow along while we build it.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/94d045e94726d0e0f2a438da29ac04fd.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming or making content? Please use the official game name Last Buzz in your video titles and stream tags so viewers can easily find us!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/3557d08026a8790ac347ad2c8be2e96d.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/3557d08026a8790ac347ad2c8be2e96d.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/3557d08026a8790ac347ad2c8be2e96d.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/60556c378f4cdb5203002bea3f0bfcff.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/60556c378f4cdb5203002bea3f0bfcff.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/60556c378f4cdb5203002bea3f0bfcff.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The flies are in your kitchen.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’re on the ceiling. One is hiding in your fridge. Another just rescued his idiot friend from a jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And someone is drawing on your wall.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Last Buzz.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One side plays as the flies: eat, hide, escape, troll the humans, and somehow keep your swarm alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other side plays as the humans: protect the house, hunt the flies, and shove every last one of them into a jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s basically hide-and-seek if everyone involved was a problem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/24b05116ac9a173de5a9fa40cc3272b9.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE SMALL. BE FAST. BE ANNOYING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a fly. Act like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly around the house, sprint across tables, crawl up walls and ceilings, squeeze through tiny gaps, and disappear somewhere the humans absolutely swear they already checked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's one problem:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're always hungry.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find food and keep eating or you'll eventually drop into a Food Coma—which is a very embarrassing way to get stuffed into a jar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if one of your friends gets caught?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go get the idiot back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break teammates out of jars, rescue knocked-down flies, sneak through vents and tiny passages, and use keyholes to see what's waiting on the other side of a door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even spray graffiti around the house, paint camouflage onto surfaces, or leave fake flies behind to make the humans question their eyesight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive together. Or at least make your death extremely inconvenient.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/831e81b89aa589e6b5b75429368e9bff.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/831e81b89aa589e6b5b75429368e9bff.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/831e81b89aa589e6b5b75429368e9bff.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db0a6efde4a963e36100b96f18555e2f.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db0a6efde4a963e36100b96f18555e2f.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db0a6efde4a963e36100b96f18555e2f.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/0c6a3457e4914a411abd7915f345a307.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/0c6a3457e4914a411abd7915f345a307.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/0c6a3457e4914a411abd7915f345a307.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/4540b2c4915471dd686cecbaa7390f1b.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YOU’RE THE HUNTER. FLIES ARE IN YOUR HOUSE. DEAL WITH THEM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They ate your food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're crawling through your vents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone drew a picture on your refrigerator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enough.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your dart rifle and start hunting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray cabinets to flush flies out of hiding. Slap sticky traps across escape routes. Drop laser mines near vents. Throw smoke grenades into rooms and watch everyone panic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, one of the smoke grenades makes flies dance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We're professionals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knock a fly down and shove it into a jar before its friends can rescue it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the whole swarm and the house is yours again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probably.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/a3dbf4791bbafd255ad05a75b4044f96.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/a3dbf4791bbafd255ad05a75b4044f96.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/a3dbf4791bbafd255ad05a75b4044f96.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/614a2d7eaef65f23e787e9d87ca622e9.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/614a2d7eaef65f23e787e9d87ca622e9.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/614a2d7eaef65f23e787e9d87ca622e9.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6b4f3ec44a65ef5395cf8fb98ddd5967.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6b4f3ec44a65ef5395cf8fb98ddd5967.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6b4f3ec44a65ef5395cf8fb98ddd5967.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/db07e4ee79bd1760fd739af9104c2c81.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/301573c43344f89ca22b379a38aa2b9e.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/301573c43344f89ca22b379a38aa2b9e.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/301573c43344f89ca22b379a38aa2b9e.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YES, THE FLIES HAVE SPRAY PAINT.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was giving flies spray paint a good idea?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can they draw on basically everything?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tag walls. Draw stupid things on furniture. Leave messages for the humans. Mark routes for your swarm. Turn someone's perfectly normal kitchen into a crime scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But graffiti isn't <i>only</i> for being annoying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint camouflage directly onto surfaces to blend in, create fake flies to waste the humans' time, or make yourself a hiding spot where there wasn't one before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art has never been more irritating.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/f123677182e9052ebdf24b701e164289.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/abc04b73ef7c2c0891a52e9ab6ed01c0.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/abc04b73ef7c2c0891a52e9ab6ed01c0.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/abc04b73ef7c2c0891a52e9ab6ed01c0.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/6e487cad01a5aa83a157e3411c3739d1.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/e3652653cba288dceffeec184218c635.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/e3652653cba288dceffeec184218c635.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/e3652653cba288dceffeec184218c635.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERYTHING IS HUGE WHEN YOU'RE A FLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kitchen counter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bedroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A toilet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To you? Normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To a fly? Basically an open-world survival game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One minute you're hiding on a ceiling fan. The next you're sprinting across someone's dinner while a human fills the room with smoke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide inside drawers, cabinets, shelves, fridges and whatever else you can squeeze yourself into. Use vents, tiny doors and sewer grates to move around the house without being spotted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And when someone opens the cabinet you're hiding in...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try not to panic.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER IMPORTANT STUFF</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–6 PLAYER ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</strong> — From tense little 1v1 hunts to six-player chaos with friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</strong> — Coordinate, scream, bargain, lie, trash-talk. Normal communication stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL FLY MOVEMENT</strong> — Fly, sprint, crawl across walls and ceilings, and squeeze through tiny spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOOD &amp; ENERGY</strong> — Keep eating and manage your energy unless you'd like to pass out at the worst possible moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RESCUE YOUR FRIENDS</strong> — Knocked down? Stuck in a jar? Your teammates can still save you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HUMAN TOYS</strong> — Dart rifles, aerosol sprays, sticky traps, laser mines and multiple types of smoke grenades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACTIVE HOUSE</strong> — Open doors and cabinets, hide inside furniture, peek through keyholes, crawl through vents and find sneaky routes between rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAFFITI &amp; CAMOUFLAGE</strong> — Draw on the house, disguise yourself, create decoys or just annoy the humans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GUIDED TUTORIAL</strong> — Learn the important stuff before your friends start yelling at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/625f9a2bb61107b70672f22e8746d20c.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/625f9a2bb61107b70672f22e8746d20c.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/625f9a2bb61107b70672f22e8746d20c.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AND WE'RE NOT DONE YET.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Buzz is being built for <strong>Early Access</strong>, and we're still adding new mechanics, items, hazards, maps, and other questionable ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will help you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will probably get you killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>That's part of the fun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If chaotic multiplayer, tiny flies with terrible judgment, and humans slowly losing control of their own house sounds like your kind of thing:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Last Buzz and follow along while we build it.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/94d045e94726d0e0f2a438da29ac04fd.webp?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming or making content? Please use the official game name Last Buzz in your video titles and stream tags so viewers can easily find us!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/3557d08026a8790ac347ad2c8be2e96d.poster.avif?t=1788224875\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/3557d08026a8790ac347ad2c8be2e96d.webm?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/extras/3557d08026a8790ac347ad2c8be2e96d.mp4?t=1788224875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Last Buzz is a 2–6 player Humans vs. Flies multiplayer game. Steal food, crawl on ceilings, hide in stupid places, and rescue your friends as a fly—or grab the bug spray, lock down the house, and hunt the little bastards before they take over.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/7d0a09a0eed81db425ba5467d3ba59374ace2f01/header.jpg?t=1788224875", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/e96d5f3a5450b806251093f54eaca1ec666896b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788224875", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4927030/e96d5f3a5450b806251093f54eaca1ec666896b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788224875", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS: Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @ 2.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</str